# Draft (machine-assisted) - needs native review
#: config/elnino.py:759
msgid ""
"Separately, the model's {hindcast} hindcast is compared against observations per grid cell: "
"rainfall against {reference}, temperature against ERA5-Land. The correlation asks whether the "
"forecast's seasonal average tracked reality year to year, which is what tells you where the model"
" has a historical track record. It adjusts no figure — it is reported beside each result so a "
"signal from a well-predicted region can be told from one that is not."
msgstr ""
"Por separado, el retropronóstico {hindcast} del modelo se compara con las observaciones celda por"
" celda: la precipitación con {reference} y la temperatura con ERA5-Land. La correlación indica si"
" la media estacional pronosticada siguió la realidad año a año, lo que muestra dónde el modelo "
"tiene un historial probado. No ajusta ninguna cifra: se informa junto a cada resultado para "
"distinguir una señal de una región bien pronosticada de otra que no lo es."

