#: config/hazards.py:468
msgid ""
"Wildfires are uncontrolled burns of vegetation, including forests, shrublands, grasslands, "
"savannas, and croplands. Fire Radiative Power (FRP) is a measure of the energy released by a fire"
" in the form of radiation."
msgstr ""
"Los incendios forestales son quemas no controladas de vegetación, como bosques, matorrales, "
"pastizales, sabanas y tierras de cultivo. La potencia radiativa del fuego (FRP) mide la energía "
"liberada por un incendio en forma de radiación."

#: config/hazards.py:475
msgid ""
"Wildfires are uncontrolled burns of vegetation, including forests, shrublands, grasslands, "
"savannas, and croplands. Fire frequency is obtained from NASA's Fire Information for Resource "
"Management System (FIRMS) and is used as a proxy for fire hazard."
msgstr ""
"Los incendios forestales son quemas no controladas de vegetación, como bosques, matorrales, "
"pastizales, sabanas y tierras de cultivo. La frecuencia de incendios se obtiene del sistema FIRMS"
" (Fire Information for Resource Management System) de la NASA y se utiliza como indicador "
"indirecto de la amenaza de incendio."

